{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_70C69AD7","title":"Teleshko Has Another Lead","entry":"Dlg_70C69AD7::entry","exit":"Dlg_70C69AD7::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_EE37943B","articyId":"72057611218074342","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Agent Teleshko","text":"I am pleased to see that my judgement of your enterprising character was correct.","speakerId":"Ntt_2B1C9A1E","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I am pleased to see that my judgement of your enterprising character was correct.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":-200.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17307","byteOffset":14436872,"byteLength":428}},{"id":"DFr_412B32EC","articyId":"72057611218074368","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Agent Teleshko","text":"Business is life. And now that you possess a Tier 1 License to Increase Capital through Commerce, it is time to start planning your next move.","speakerId":"Ntt_2B1C9A1E","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Business is life. And now that you possess a Tier 1 License to Increase Capital through Commerce, it is time to start planning your next move.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":662.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"28688","byteOffset":18736272,"byteLength":488}},{"id":"DFr_8B3466AB","articyId":"72057611218074380","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Agent Teleshko","text":"Do not call it \"LICCY Business\". It is a License to Increase Capital through Commerce. And now that you possess a Grade 1, it is time to think about your next move.","speakerId":"Ntt_2B1C9A1E","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Do not call it \"LICCY Business\". It is a License to Increase Capital through Commerce. And now that you possess a Grade 1, it is time to think about your next move.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":662.0,"y":225.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22455","byteOffset":16380104,"byteLength":508}},{"id":"DFr_D9E5FEB1","articyId":"72057611218074412","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Agent Teleshko","text":"Your feelings do not apply to this matter. Do I need to remind you of the obligatory nature of the LICC?","speakerId":"Ntt_2B1C9A1E","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Your feelings do not apply to this matter. Do I need to remind you of the obligatory nature of the LICC?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":1562.0,"y":250.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"31571","byteOffset":19825136,"byteLength":412}},{"id":"DFr_2E92B9A8","articyId":"72057611218074426","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Agent Teleshko","text":"Hmm. There is a bar in Lowtown that has been on the decline for some time. I believe the owner could be persuaded to give up a Tier 2 license.","speakerId":"Ntt_2B1C9A1E","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Hmm. There is a bar in Lowtown that has been on the decline for some time. I believe the owner could be persuaded to give up a Tier 2 license.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2175.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29148","byteOffset":18908944,"byteLength":488}},{"id":"DFr_0F35ADC4","articyId":"72057611218074448","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Agent Teleshko","text":"Because they did not increase capital through commerce.","speakerId"